{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2023-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1696118400, "end_date": 1696723199, "month_true_total": 106, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:52:40 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "147796498", "author": {"steamid": "76561198020297825", "personaname": "Boz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198020297825/", "num_games_owned": 334, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 3469, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1849, "last_played": 1731322439, "avatar": "e12b11feb5b02f8cd0aa40ef320f01329e137982"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fantastic roguelite FPS. Great music, many different weapons with good crisp shooting and movement. Enemies and bosses are also varied.\nOnly downsides are depending on personal taste: the colorful graphics and maybe the gameplay with going from small arena to small arena to fight in.", "timestamp_created": 1696679186, "timestamp_updated": 1696679186, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147784667", "author": {"steamid": "76561198981670585", "personaname": "Dragonosaurus", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198981670585/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 20882, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20686, "last_played": 1771477666, "avatar": "2745ad2cc0cf81b539d3a2552bea04fd08995e39"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10\n\nThis game is incredible! It's a fast paced, movement-centric FPS rogue-like. The weapons are cool, the upgrades are impactful, and the music and art style is a solid win for me.  The enemies are also all good, but not unbeatable. When you get overwhelmed, it mostly feels like you were outplayed rather than cheated by the game. It's one of those games that leaves you going \"just one more run\" at 2 in the morning. Two thumbs way up, and totally worth the price tag. This is going to be a permanent resident on my desktop.\n\nEDIT: Still playing this after the official release and it's still a great game. And the devs keep updating it with cool things. Definitely worth the price tag.", "timestamp_created": 1696661111, "timestamp_updated": 1740962733, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147783897", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972390763", "personaname": "Bingledorf Higgens Sr.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972390763/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 178, "playtime_forever": 7121, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1310, "last_played": 1782880984, "avatar": "5076cb4b31180b9fb9b6520693e7906f4c89b8ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "Robot shoot things, go boom.", "timestamp_created": 1696659633, "timestamp_updated": 1696659633, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472972989082336426", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "147744417", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017520724", "personaname": "ORIGINAL_HD.avi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017520724/", "num_games_owned": 107, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 9193, "pl